Let $X_0, X_1,Y_0,Y_1$ be defined as above, and let

\begin{eqnarray*}
v_1  & := & \sum_{l=\big[\frac{k}{2}\big]+1}^{k} \f_{l(l+1)-k+n-k^2}
+\sum_{l=\big[\frac{k+1}{2}\big]+1}^{k} \f_{l^2-k+n-k^2} \, ,\\[0.2cm]
w_1 & := & \sum_{l=\big[\frac{k}{2}\big]+1}^{k} \big(a+4(k-l) \,b \big)\, \f_{l(l+1)-k+n-k^2}^{\mathrm{t}} \\[0.1cm]
&& + \sum_{l=\big[\frac{k+1}{2}\big]+1}^{k} \big(a+(4k-4l+2) \,b \big) \, \f_{l^2-k+n-k^2}^{\mathrm{t}} +
(n-k^2)\, b\, \f_{\big[\frac{k^2}{4}\big]+1+n-k^2}^{\mathrm{t}}.
\end{eqnarray*}

Then $(X_0, X_1; Y_0, Y_1; v_1,w_1)$ is a $\c^{*}$-fixed point of
$\mathfrak{M}^{\tau}_{\z_2} (n-k, n; \mathrm{1} )$.
